### 1. GET All Animatronics (Status 200 OK)
GET http://localhost:3000/animatronics

### 2. POST Create Animatronic (Status 201 Created)
POST http://localhost:3000/animatronics
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Foxy the Pirate",
  "form": "Fox",
  "seriesGame": "FNAF 1",
  "threatLevel": 9,
  "isPossessed": true,
  "behaviorNote": "Berlari ke West Hall jika jarang dipantau kamera."
}

### 3. GET One Animatronic by ID (Status 200 OK)
GET http://localhost:3000/animatronics/3

### 4. PATCH Update Animatronic (Status 200 OK)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/animatronics/3
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "threatLevel": 10,
  "behaviorNote": "Menguras daya pintu kiri setiap kali mengetuk."
}

### 5. DELETE Animatronic (Status 200 OK)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/animatronics/3

### 6. Uji Error 1: ConflictException (Status 409 - Nama Duplikat)
POST http://localhost:3000/animatronics
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Freddy Fazbear",
  "form": "Bear",
  "seriesGame": "FNAF 1",
  "threatLevel": 8,
  "isPossessed": true
}

### 7. Uji Error 2: NotFoundException (Status 404 - ID Tidak Ditemukan)
GET http://localhost:3000/animatronics/999

### 8. Uji Validasi DTO: ValidationPipe (Status 400 Bad Request)
POST http://localhost:3000/animatronics
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "AB",
  "form": "Alien",
  "seriesGame": "F1",
  "threatLevel": 50,
  "isPossessed": "bukan-boolean"
}